textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 26, "prompt": "You hear a paramedic briefing a doctor on a recent emergency\nadmission.\nThe paramedic says it’s important to\nA. try to settle the patient.\nB. notify the patient’s family.\nC. keep the patient hydrated.", "sourcePage": 155, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear an anaesthetist talking with a patient prior to her surgery.\nWhat does the patient want to know?\nA. Potential risks while anaesthetised\nB. Post-operative pain management\nC. The length of sedation involved", "sourcePage": 155, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a trainee doctor telling her supervisor about an uncomfortable\nsituation she recently encountered with an end of life patient.\nThe trainee found it difficult to\nA. connect with the family member.\nB. maintain control of her emotions.\nC. provide advice on the best course of action.", "sourcePage": 156, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a nurse briefing a colleague at the end of his shift.\nWhat does he instruct his colleague to do?\nA. Monitor the patients pain level\nB. Ensure the patient remains lying down\nC. Keep the patient’s wife up to date", "sourcePage": 156, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a veterinarian and the owner of a cat discussing how to give\ninsulin to her pet.\nWhat does the veterinarian say is most important?\nA. Giving more than the recommended dose\nB. Keeping the insulin refrigerated\nC. Avoiding shaking the bottle", "sourcePage": 156, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 160, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["b76a973ddc9416a6e035879a4c12608d1cf631a50e79c32474d25a6c99ac5ae9"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
